The Go2 URDF and DAE model assets under packages/go2_description are derived
from unitreerobotics/unitree_ros, commit
d96d8f63ae17a7108d4f7229c00ef875ba7129c9. They remain subject to Unitree
Robotics' BSD 3-Clause License, reproduced as
packages/go2_description/LICENSE.unitree.

The pinned unitree_sdk2 and unitree_ros2 submodules remain subject to their
upstream BSD-3-Clause licenses. The SDK-only chassis and camera daemon install
images also contain Unitree SDK2's bundled CycloneDDS/CycloneDDS-CXX runtime
(EPL-2.0 OR EDL-1.0), RapidJSON (MIT plus its bundled notices), and Iceoryx
(Apache-2.0). Their complete upstream license texts are retained in the pinned
submodule and copied into each installed daemon image under
share/licenses/unitree_sdk2/. See THIRD_PARTY.md for exact paths.

The base model geometry is unchanged. This repository adds zero-offset
`base_link` and `utlidar_lidar` alias joints so Robonix/Nav2 and the official
unitree_ros2 topic frame share one connected TF tree.
